From e6543f76b7c4b509b2c69da6ac64a2848571ac75 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Priyadharshini Gowthaman <pgowtham@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Mar 2026 11:40:05 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] UPSTREAM:PROTOCOL: sigma_dut: CE1 and CE2 changes.

Added PasswordIDChange parameter, EPPKE-PSK-SAE as keymgnt parameter,
PMKSACachingPrivacy, WPA3-COMPAT-COEX as keymgnt parameter, IEEE8021x_Auth
parameter to AP_SET_SECURITY CAPI.
Added RSNO CAPI support. RSNO1E and RSNO2E for AKMsuitetype, pairwise
cipher and PMF.
Enable logging support for dev_upload_log CAPI.

Patch-dependency: none

Signed-off-by: Priyadharshini Gowthaman <pgowtham@qti.qualcomm.com>
